title: "gnss-time"
abstract: >-
  Type-safe GNSS time scales: GPS, GLONASS, Galileo, BeiDou, TAI, UTC —
  strongly typed time model with explicit conversion semantics and zero-cost
  arithmetic, no_std by default.
